WEBVTT

00:05:57.602 --> 00:06:00.505
Usalama wa watoto
ulimwenguni kote.

00:06:02.542 --> 00:06:04.796
Lakini labda zaidi ya hivyo.

00:06:05.264 --> 00:06:08.280
Watoto na vijana wenyewe,

00:06:08.304 --> 00:06:09.681
kwa sehemu kwa msaada wa teknolojia,

00:06:09.705 --> 00:06:10.954
lakini kwa sasa wana sauti

00:06:10.978 --> 00:06:13.385
ambayo sidhani kama
walikuwa nayo hapo awali.

00:06:13.409 --> 00:06:14.893
Na wanatumia sauti hiyo,

00:06:14.917 --> 00:06:17.807
Sio tu kuzungumzia hali
inayowazunguka

00:06:17.831 --> 00:06:20.029
au kile wanachojua kinahitaji kuboreshwa,

00:06:20.053 --> 00:06:22.378
lakini kuwa sehemu ya suluhu ya mambo

00:06:22.402 --> 00:06:25.156
ambayo yanaelezea
na kuathiri maisha yao.

00:06:26.179 --> 00:06:27.633
Fikiri kuhusu wanaharakati hawa wadogo

00:06:27.657 --> 00:06:29.917
ambao wanazungumza kupinga
ukeketaji wa wanawake,

00:06:29.941 --> 00:06:34.728
ndoa za utotoni, uonevu wa kimtandao,
shule salama, migogoro inayoumiza--